{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會討論新田科技城撥款申請等／亞運香港運動員在沙田巴士巡遊\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261027.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會發展事務委員會今日(10月27日)開會討論新田科技城撥款申請，以及紅磡站周邊用地發展。另外，亞運香港運動員在沙田巴士巡遊，由沙田大會堂出發，經大圍到頌安邨。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:21:30.814772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T23:33:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.244514+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:18:27.386917+00:00","content_hash":"b94dae7dd4d55974dfffe241c67591d947f4c45626a4e6e85c5bb6756a2642a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:21:30.814772+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}